WEBVTT

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.420
How do you like it so far, Ojo?

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.440
Being able to experience
the great outdoors

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.970
and getting to play in the snow at the same time…

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.300
is what makes skiing great.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.550
Isn’t this fun?

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:14.600
I think it is.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.800
It feels more enjoyable than normal.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.430
I’m glad I asked you to come with me.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.140
You can ask me to go any time.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.110
We are dating, after all!

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.880
I’ll make room for you in my schedule any time, Ojo.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.220
Mizuhara…

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.280
I appreciate your kind words, but…

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:40.290
why is it that I feel like laughter is swelling up inside me?

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.080
Because it’s just that funny.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.520
Do you really think this is the time…

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.520
to be having such a happy conversation?!

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:47.880
Shut up!

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.030
I couldn’t stand this situation otherwise!

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:18.690
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:24.320
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:27.240
The sweetness

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.370
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:33.820
The time

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:40.210
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:48.340
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.230
float in the wind,

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.110
flowing toward you,

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:55.580
freely.

00:01:55.580 --> 00:02:02.400
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:06.020
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:11.020
The Steamy Hell
of Love and Death!
The Great Approach!?

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:19.090
Nope, it’s no use. It won’t connect.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:20.970
We’re completely lost.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.330
Sometimes unexpected accidents happen.

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:26.100
Sorry, Ojo, that this is happening.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.330
Everything can be a learning experience.

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:29.690
Don’t worry about it.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:33.280
I was the one, after all, who asked you all to go, and…

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:34.360
And?

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:37.860
A situation like this isn’t that bad since you’re around.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:38.550
Ojo…

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.800
Why are you getting all sappy, huh?

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.660
So, Kane-chan, are you okay with Ryo’s date being Emi-rin?

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:47.660
Well, um…

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:52.090
as long as she really is
the one he is in love with…

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.670
There’s nothing to worry about concerning my feelings either.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.450
I would be a poor fiancée if I were shocked by such a minor incident.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:04.680
Ryo-sama is only putting on an act to make Emiho-sama

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:09.100
rethink her arranged marriage.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.310
Besides, if he had to have an affair,

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:16.690
I’d like him to do it before we are officially engaged.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:21.720
So, Ryo-sama, don’t worry about me, and enjoy your affair.

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:24.240
Proceed, proceed.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.480
Why, you!

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:27.180
Oh, crap!

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.790
We don’t have any more of these.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:31.190
Don’t worry, everyone.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:37.710
This is the same fortified, solid fuel that is used by the special units in the military.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.070
With this…

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.090
the fire will keep burning for a hundred consecutive hours.

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.640
I won’t ask where the hell you pulled that out from…

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.040
If you have something that useful, you should bring it out immediately!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.770
It’s not lighting.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.000
That’s strange.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:03:59.640
Oh?

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:02.110
What was that?

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.050
It’s only the usual.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.250
This situation has gotten even worse.

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:20.500
Anyway, we can’t just idle around.

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:23.080
We must move forward, even if only a little bit!

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.930
C-Captain!

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:27.260
I am really done for.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.890
No! You’ll die if you fall asleep!

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:29.890
Wake up!

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:31.920
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.300
Stop doing that!

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:37.500
Look, everyone.

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:39.400
T-That’s…

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:45.410
We’re no longer outside in a blizzard,
but it’s still freezing in here.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.350
What should we do?

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:54.540
Ryo-sama,

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:58.550
warming each other by using our bodies would be the best thing to do in this situation.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:04:59.780
<i>The</i> best thing.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:01.380
Sorry,

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:04.080
I’d much rather freeze to death than be held by you.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.080
Brother!

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:06.780
Oh, that’s so cruel.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.330
How could you die before me?

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.470
Akane, no!

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.300
I won’t leave you alone!

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.550
Never!

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.200
Brother…

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.130
Akane…

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:28.140
Well, then, what about me, your so-called girlfriend?

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:31.450
It’s no use trying to compete against Kane-chan.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.650
So, Emi-rin, what if we save ourselves?

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:34.580
Wait! Hold on!

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:37.830
I don’t swing that way…

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:41.210
It’s a life or death situation!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:44.700
Fine, then I’ll force you to!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:46.700
No way!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.740
Then what am I supposed to do?!

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.520
Hello? This is Shizuka.

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.610
Yes, everything is fine here.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:01.880
But we may be a little late coming home.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.740
Sh-Shizuka…

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:05.340
Is that…

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:11.280
Oh! It’s a satellite phone that can be used even on top of Mount Everest.

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:15.560
People tend to get worried when they can’t track down my exact whereabouts.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.310
That’s it!

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:22.070
Since you have something that is that useful,
call for a rescue team right now!!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:23.820
R-Rescue team?!

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:25.340
No way!

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:28.090
I’m enjoying my precious time with Ryo-sama!

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.910
I’d much rather do this than be disturbed!

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.930
How could you do that?!

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.770
That was the only way to save our…

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:38.340
Huh? A splash?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.470
T-This is…!

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.650
It’s so serene.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:01.960
Yeah.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.430
I’m saved.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.810
I didn’t expect to find a hot spring here.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:17.210
Yeah.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.560
It’s so refreshing.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:24.820
Your side is over there!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.990
Hey! Ryo! Don’t be so violent!

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:33.240
Say no to violence!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:34.480
It’s her fault!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:38.810
Don’t look, you idiot! Pervert!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.820
I didn’t look!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:52.590
But this is fun, it’s just like a school trip.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:53.870
Yeah.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:57.350
But, Emi-rin, is something wrong?

00:07:57.350 --> 00:08:01.480
Oh, I had something on my mind.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.730
Uh? What is this?

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:08.190
Don’t be so serious all the time.

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:11.510
Right now, you should be having fun, Emiho-sama!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:21.670
Your skin looks so smooth up close.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:23.900
Do you really think so?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.950
I want to touch it!

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:44.250
I’ll be boiled alive
if I stay in here too long.

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.630
I need to cool down.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:06.170
We can’t get out of the spring like this!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.450
It’s just as I thought.

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:11.450
What, Emi-rin?

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.970
Calm down and think carefully about it.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:16.950
We were happy, so we went into the hot spring.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.450
But once you step into this blizzard…

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:24.180
It’s a hot steam hell.

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:29.020
Once you step in, you can never get out until the blizzard stops.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:00.770
Ugh! No!

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:03.160
I don’t want to get boiled alive here!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:05.210
I’m getting out.

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:07.550
Miki-chan!

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:19.080
Oh no! Now I’m gonna freeze!

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.180
I’m coming right over!

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:46.060
She’s saved!

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:47.330
I’m so glad!

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.170
You pervert!

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:54.200
Brother!

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:54.920
It’s so cold!
Brother!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.910
It hurts!
It’s so cold!

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.040
So hot!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:06.980
Man, we’re finally safe.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:08.650
Are you sure?

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.220
Wasn’t it fun, everyone?

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:19.450
We stayed here for so long, so…

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.730
Shi-Shizuka…

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:26.470
Is that…

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:30.360
Oh! It’s a super powerful transmitter.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:34.570
No matter where I am, they can instantly spot my location.

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:36.170
Oh?

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:39.760
Why, you!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:45.850
If you have something that useful, then bring it out immediately!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:49.100
Ack!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.950
If you have something that useful, then bring it out immediately!

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:58.100
Mizuhara, is this what a date
is usually like?

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:02.220
You really need an extraordinary amount of mental and physical strength to do it.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.180
So, where do we go next?

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.640
Now that you got me started,
you have to take me everywhere.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.750
To be continued.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:13.240
The moment came

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:17.240
very much out of the blue.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:22.380
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:25.100
then started to change everything.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:28.930
If my meeting you

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.780
is not by fate,

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:38.140
there are no miracles,

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:43.330
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.720
Embracing love,

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:50.650
kissing love,

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:54.580
holding love,

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:58.920
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:02.910
Please look at me and me alone,

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:06.330
forever.
